# .nda-blocklist — single source of NDA-sensitive terms (vault amendment A3)
#
# Read by three independent gates, all of which FAIL the build/commit on a match:
#   1. the MDX loader          (src/lib/mdxLoader.ts, Phase 2)
#   2. the CI scan             (.github/workflows/qa.yml)
#   3. the optional pre-commit hook
#
# Format: one term per line, case-insensitive, matched as a FIXED string (grep -F) against
# everything under content/case-studies/. Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are stripped.
# The CI scan FAILS if no usable terms remain — an empty blocklist must never read as "clean".
#
# Replace the placeholders below with real employer names, client names, internal project
# codenames, and any proprietary metric labels that must never reach a public repo.
# Keep this file committed: the gates need it, and it contains terms to EXCLUDE, not secrets.

REPLACE_ME_CLIENT_NAME
REPLACE_ME_PROJECT_CODENAME
REPLACE_ME_INTERNAL_METRIC
